      "snippet": "BREAKING: SB 2471 has been signed into law! It’s the first of its kind in the nation and renders the Supreme Court’s Citizens United decision irrelevant in Hawaii. \n\nThis is a win for the movement to get big money, especially dark money, out of politics.",
